[{"id":3478986782,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7PXSAe","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected (including undo/redo).\r\n\r\nIn terms of UX, I like how it works.\r\n\r\nVisually, I would prefer the scaling lines to match the accent color (blue) so it feels more in line with the selected keyframe colors. Also, I think the lines could stand be made a tad thinner (one pixel thinner than currently would be good). They can easily overlap most of a keyframe icon right now:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"74\" height=\"119\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0f539529-92ed-4260-b0d6-d9afed298078\" />\r\n\r\nThe change would be visual only, it wouldn't impact the \"hitbox\" of the line so to speak.\r\n\r\nI noticed two issues:\r\n\r\n- Editing is still allowed in read-only (i.e. imported) Animation resources, even though dragging individual keyframes is already prevented:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/38da620d-dd26-4ed7-901d-af5319af313e\r\n\r\n- When scaling down to a near-zero value, the selection will constantly flicker back-and-forth. This occurs both with snapping enabled and disabled, but it's more noticeable with snapping enabled as shown here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bd7b6575-0ec2-4876-8255-9ba12a4d59f6\r\n\r\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112488#pullrequestreview-3478986782","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112488","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112488#pullrequestreview-3478986782"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112488"}},"submitted_at":"2025-11-18T17:34:10Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3506208025,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Q_H0Z","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Works great now :slightly_smiling_face: Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nI think it's good to go from an UX perspective.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112488#pullrequestreview-3506208025","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112488","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112488#pullrequestreview-3506208025"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112488"}},"submitted_at":"2025-11-25T17:48:56Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3520086214,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7R0EDG","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"We are all happy with this change in the animation meeting. \r\n\r\nWe should consider the UX implication of the selection box being extended to the sides of the keyframe. is it better to align it with the exact box of the keyframes being resized/moved?\r\n\r\nWe would also like to see #105151 supported for a Blender-like workflow after this is merged.\r\n\r\nWe still need to review code.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112488#pullrequestreview-3520086214","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112488","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112488#pullrequestreview-3520086214"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112488"}},"submitted_at":"2025-11-28T21:30:04Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3530732081,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7ScrIx","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"While not a critical issue that would corrupt data, but there are several problematic points that must be fixed.\r\n\r\n### Regarding keys with length - such as AnimationPlaybackTrack / AudioTrack\r\n\r\n- The time of the retrieved key is centered, not at the start\r\n  - Consider them as having only one discrete key at the start, since they only have a method key at the start for triggering\r\n- They disappear when moving\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3b1ad8b5-b5b6-4855-b89d-5c91c4f54d14\r\n\r\n### Regarding negative time\r\n\r\n- Keys placed in negative time due to scaling are deselected, this lacks consistency with movement behavior\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a65e6df6-ac6d-4a23-9153-120f0be87020\r\n\r\nIn the first place, keys in negative time are not processed correctly. Ideally, we should implement movement that trims keys to prevent them from moving into negative time. In other words, we should prohibit box scaling or movement into negative time. This might be optional, but further design consideration is needed for this usability aspect.\r\n\r\n### Other\r\n\r\n- When the box cursor (the lines at both ends) is close to a key, movement occurs instead of scaling even the cursor is `<->`, it seems the cursor shape detected position and the actual click position are mismatched\r\n- The cursor changes unexpectedly during movement, it seems the moving state detection is lacking\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/70734e36-005c-44bf-913e-5cdde005ff3a\r\n","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112488#pullrequestreview-3530732081","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112488","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112488#pullrequestreview-3530732081"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112488"}},"submitted_at":"2025-12-02T15:26:20Z","commit_id":null},{"id":4491208213,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC7JmFQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThous